message: "If you use this code or site, please cite it as below, and cite the data sources listed in the README."
title: "Molecular Tissue Fingerprints: a 20-gene panel, its conformal guarantee, and what a within-study fingerprint can identify"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-26"
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "[team name — edit CITATION.cff and site/about.html]"
keywords:
  - MoTrPAC
  - tissue classification
  - conformal prediction
  - batch effects
  - GTEx
  - rat BodyMap
abstract: >-
  A leakage-safe evaluation of compact tissue fingerprints in the MoTrPAC 6-month rat endurance-training
  transcriptomes (19 tissues, 899 vials, 50 animals), with split-conformal prediction sets, shift tests
  (held-out sex, another laboratory, another species) and an identifiability audit of the processing batches.
  Stanford Bioinformatics Center / MoTrPAC Hackathon, September 2026.
